    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forklift is a useful and powerful industrial truck used to lift and move materials over short distances, also called lift truck, fork truck, fork hoist, and forklift truck. Forklifts have become an indispensable piece of equipment in manufacturing and warehousing. Along with forklifts, the game also includes pallet trucks, reach trucks, and VNA, allowing you to experience a wide range of industrial equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up for a real forklift gaming experience? We worked really hard and thoroughly to bring you great forklift simulator realistic graphics in one of the best forklift games, now including pallet trucks, reach trucks, and VNA for a complete experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.poster.avif?t=1755202681\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.webm?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.mp4?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAL WAREHOUSE EXPERIENCE Not only do you need to ride the forklift, but you'll also need to manually move boxes like in a real warehouse. Be careful in how you manage the forklift; you can cause different problems in this realistic experience. Plus, there's a free-room<strong>\u00a0</strong>where you can choose 'Mission Generate Random,' and a truck will arrive to unload or load pallets, adding an extra layer of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.poster.avif?t=1755202681\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.webm?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.mp4?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULL CONTROL In one of the best warehouse and logistics simulators, you'll have full control over the forklift and other industrial vehicles. That's why we can proudly say that this is one of the best forklift games. All you need to do is show that you have the skills and orientation to ride the forklift, pallet truck, reach truck, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STUNNING GRAPHICS The graphics are one of the best things about this simulator, making it one of the best forklift truck games. If you're looking for a forklift demo game, you'll rarely find a better and more realistic experience, now with added vehicle options and interactive missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENJOY THE FREE RIDE Enjoy the game as one of the best free forklift demos available on VR today.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forklift is a useful and powerful industrial truck used to lift and move materials over short distances, also called lift truck, fork truck, fork hoist, and forklift truck. Forklifts have become an indispensable piece of equipment in manufacturing and warehousing. Along with forklifts, the game also includes pallet trucks, reach trucks, and VNA, allowing you to experience a wide range of industrial equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up for a real forklift gaming experience? We worked really hard and thoroughly to bring you great forklift simulator realistic graphics in one of the best forklift games, now including pallet trucks, reach trucks, and VNA for a complete experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.poster.avif?t=1755202681\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.webm?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/d022913e3a1bd3a06ed4f8cba315368f.mp4?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAL WAREHOUSE EXPERIENCE Not only do you need to ride the forklift, but you'll also need to manually move boxes like in a real warehouse. Be careful in how you manage the forklift; you can cause different problems in this realistic experience. Plus, there's a free-room<strong>\u00a0</strong>where you can choose 'Mission Generate Random,' and a truck will arrive to unload or load pallets, adding an extra layer of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.poster.avif?t=1755202681\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.webm?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450710/extras/4634a9bfd922c26f99728c5f54fafb5e.mp4?t=1755202681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULL CONTROL In one of the best warehouse and logistics simulators, you'll have full control over the forklift and other industrial vehicles. That's why we can proudly say that this is one of the best forklift games. All you need to do is show that you have the skills and orientation to ride the forklift, pallet truck, reach truck, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STUNNING GRAPHICS The graphics are one of the best things about this simulator, making it one of the best forklift truck games. If you're looking for a forklift demo game, you'll rarely find a better and more realistic experience, now with added vehicle options and interactive missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENJOY THE FREE RIDE Enjoy the game as one of the best free forklift demos available on VR today.</p>",
